   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"7\">\n  <li>Bananas cost $0.50 each, and apples cost $1.00 each. <br><strong>Select all three</strong>&nbsp;combinations of bananas and apples that Elena could buy for exactly $3.50.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>2 bananas and 2 apples</li>\n  <li>3 bananas and 2 apples</li>\n  <li>1 banana and 2 apples</li>\n  <li>1 banana and 3 apples</li>\n  <li>5 bananas and 2 apples</li>\n  <li>5 bananas and 1 apple</li>\n</ol>",
